-----------------------------------------
DATA-SPECIFIC INFORMATION FOR: CLP_trt.csv
-----------------------------------------
CLP_trt is the 2026 version of pcrispus_wDNRtrtdat

 Variable List
               
    . Name: Lake.ID
       Description: Minnesota Department of Waters waterbody identifier number (DOW ID)
                    	
    . Name: Year
       Description: Year of record

    . Name: Lake.x
       Description: lake name used in analysis

    . Name: Trt
       Description: Indicates if the lake in that year was treated with herbicides targeting curlyleaf pondweed.
			1 = treated
			0 = untreated

    . Name: YrsTrt
       Description: Number of years (in the 10 year window before the record) the lake has previously been treated with herbicides targeting curlyleaf pondweed.
                    	
    . Name: PrevAUGSecchi
       Description: Previous year's August Secchi depth measurement (meters)
       Source: MPCA
                    
    . Name: Ice_off
       Description: Last date of full ice cover in spring (day of year)
       Source: Jake Walsh ice off prediction model
                    
    . Name: Snow
       Description: mean depth of snow cover (inches)
       Source: National Weather Service
       Note: Right now the snow data is the average snowfall between Dec 1 and March 31 averaged over greater south central Minnesota. Will get site specific info soon.
    
    . Name: APRMAYPcri
       Description: P. crispus frequency of occurrence at sites w/ depth < 4.6m as reported in PI Charter for April or May survey
    
    . Name: JUNPcri
       Description: P. crispus frequency of occurrence at sites w/ depth < 4.6m as reported in PI Charter for June survey

    . Name: DIFF.4.6
       Description: difference between APRMAYPcri and JUNPcri

    . Name: County
       Description: County where lake is located

    . Name: Lake.area.acre
       Description: lake surface area (acres)
    
    . Name: Proportion.littoral
       Description: Proportion of lake total area that is littoral

    . Name: Max.depth
       Description: Maximum depth of waterbody

    . Name: Acres_Chem
       Description: Acres of lake treated with herbicides targeting P. crispus. Data from MN Department of Natural Resources permitting/ treatment records.

    . Name: litt.ac
       Description: Area of lake surface with depth < 4.6m (acres)

    . Name: perc.lit.chem
       Description: Proportion of lake littoral area (<4.6m) treated with herbicides targeting P. crispus.


